Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Hi,

no, how to account for uncertainty about measurement location in the
INLA context is an open research problem; the most straightforward
method is based on iterated Monte Carlo sampling, but I'm not aware of
any published papers that do this in combination with INLA yet. We've
looked at implementing that as part of inlabru, and to develop a more
direct method, but didn't have time to do it.

Finn

