> > Depends on why you want to do this.
> >
> > If it is to avoid crazy results/overfitting, I would strongly
> > recommend using sensible priors instead of restricting the logit
> > scale.
> >
> > If you have too many fixed effects, creating a sensible prior for
> > them can be difficult.
> >
> > Haakon
