Hello, Håvard Rue.

Can you please direct me to some documentation that would help me understand the correct way to do that?

In my example, I used the internal marginals of the hyperpar to create a table string for use as a prior for the updated model.  Because there's only one hyperpar in the example, the prior I constructed is the same as the joint prior, right?

ih <- m1$internal.marginals.hyperpar[[1]]
